=== f19-8: filtered scalar CTE root LEFT JOIN cte — permanent rejection ===
An outer join below a scalar CTE root with a WHERE clause is not supported in an aggregate query: the root is a single-row CTE lookup, which cannot NULL-extend the outer join's misses.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Outer join below a filtered scalar CTE root not supported.

